<title>POLAND: Forte Q1 net rises to PLN 4.1 mln.</title>
<headline>Forte Q1 net rises to PLN 4.1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Forte preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 5.72 vs	5.42</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   5.52 vs	3.43</p>
<p>    net profit				 4.06 vs	3.43</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Fabryki Mebli Forte SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 77.06 vs     64.70</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  46.77 vs     45.95</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		     0.14 vs	0.22</p>
<p>    income tax				 1.45 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs	0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     1.22 vs	0.49</p>
<p>    financial costs			  1.28 vs	2.24</p>
<p>    investment				 6.82 vs	1.53</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
